## About Brandskyddsföreningen

Brandskyddsföreningen (the Swedish Fire Protection Association) is a member organisation working for a fire-safe Sweden. It publishes guidance, runs training, and drives the development of methods for systematic fire safety work.

## Connection to regulations

The association's guidance complements the binding requirements in the Act on Protection against Accidents and Boverket's regulations.
